### ==============================================================================
### AgendaDmnOrchestrationController: KieSession Targeting DMN via Agenda Group
### Demonstrates:
### 1. Programmatic targeting via kieSession.getAgenda().getAgendaGroup(name).setFocus()
### 2. Drools rule invoking a Spring service function via Drools 'global'
### 3. Bridging DMN decision into Working Memory as DmnDecisionFact
### 4. Drools rule overrides & enrichments on top of DMN outcomes
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. List Available Agenda Groups & Capabilities
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orchestration/agenda-groups
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Generic Orchestrator: Target Any Registered DMN via 'dynamic-dmn-runner'
# Evaluates 'insurance-pricing' DMN inside the targeted agenda group
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orchestration/agenda-dmn/evaluate
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "agendaGroup": "dynamic-dmn-runner",
  "targetModelId": "insurance-pricing",
  "inputs": {
    "driverAge": 32,
    "accidentCount": 0,
    "vehicleType": "SEDAN"
  }
}

###

### 3. Loan Orchestration: High-Credit Score VIP Override (-1.0% Rate Concession)
# Agenda group 'loan-approval-orchestration' runs 'loan-eligibility' DMN (Prime rate = 6.5%).
# Drools rule 'High Credit Score Prime Rate Override' checks creditScore >= 800
# and automatically reduces interest rate to 5.5%!
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orchestration/agenda-dmn/evaluate
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "agendaGroup": "loan-approval-orchestration",
  "targetModelId": "loan-eligibility",
  "inputs": {
    "applicantId": "VIP-999",
    "applicantName": "Bruce Wayne",
    "age": 36,
    "monthlyIncome": 120000.0,
    "creditScore": 820,
    "requestedAmount": 300000.0
  }
}

###

### 4. Loan Orchestration: Standard Prime (Credit Score < 800, No Rate Override)
# Credit score 760 (< 800) -> DMN rate 6.5% stays unchanged.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orchestration/agenda-dmn/evaluate
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "agendaGroup": "loan-approval-orchestration",
  "targetModelId": "loan-eligibility",
  "inputs": {
    "applicantId": "STD-500",
    "applicantName": "Clark Kent",
    "age": 32,
    "monthlyIncome": 70000.0,
    "creditScore": 760,
    "requestedAmount": 150000.0
  }
}

###

### 5. Retail Orchestration: Evaluates Pricing & Attaches $25 Seasonal Loyalty Voucher
# Evaluates retail DMN inside 'retail-pricing-orchestration'
# and Drools automatically attaches a $25 Holiday Gift Card to the final decision!
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orchestration/agenda-dmn/evaluate
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "agendaGroup": "retail-pricing-orchestration",
  "targetModelId": "insurance-pricing",
  "inputs": {
    "driverAge": 28,
    "accidentCount": 0,
    "vehicleType": "SUV"
  }
}
